WEBVTT

01:51.480 --> 01:52.480
My children,

01:54.000 --> 01:55.640
it's been 30 years.

01:57.400 --> 02:00.080
We are at the final turning point.

02:02.760 --> 02:05.600
It will all be settled soon.

02:32.080 --> 02:33.920
Wang Pu.

04:15.240 --> 04:17.040
GRAVE OF WANG PU, DECEASED SON

04:17.120 --> 04:18.600
He hasn't been dead long.

04:18.680 --> 04:20.240
I can preserve the body.

04:21.360 --> 04:22.280
But can you wait?

04:22.360 --> 04:25.160
Growing a face takes 100 days.

04:25.240 --> 04:26.400
I cannot wait.

04:26.480 --> 04:27.520
Seven days at most.

04:30.400 --> 04:31.800
And you tell me now?

04:31.880 --> 04:33.800
Did you bring me here
just to waste my time?

04:34.520 --> 04:36.520
The aim of growing a face

04:36.600 --> 04:38.120
is to protect the puppet.

04:38.680 --> 04:39.680
Since he's already dead,

04:41.000 --> 04:41.920
Mr. Long,

04:43.960 --> 04:45.640
just cut his face off for me.

04:49.760 --> 04:51.440
Sometimes I wonder,

04:52.120 --> 04:54.200
between you and Yan Fengshan,

04:55.360 --> 04:56.920
who is the more terrifying one.

04:57.800 --> 04:59.440
Before entering the palace,

05:00.160 --> 05:01.920
Gu Yu left me a 100-man unit.

05:03.120 --> 05:05.920
But Yan Fengshan's residence
is crawling with shadow guards.

05:06.000 --> 05:07.240
According to the plan,

05:07.320 --> 05:10.160
we must slip in without a sound

05:10.760 --> 05:12.280
and place the puppet inside.

05:12.840 --> 05:15.760
For that, 100 men are far from enough.

05:18.640 --> 05:19.680
I understand.

05:22.000 --> 05:23.440
I will help.

05:23.520 --> 05:25.680
Once you kill Yan Fengshan,

05:26.240 --> 05:28.280
start living like a human again.

05:42.040 --> 05:43.800
Desperate imagination

05:45.760 --> 05:49.000
can bring the dead back to your side.

05:50.600 --> 05:52.480
Don't you find that interesting?

05:54.120 --> 05:55.840
Can't you see Wang Pu now?

06:23.280 --> 06:24.640
A brilliant stratagem

06:25.680 --> 06:27.000
indeed.

06:28.640 --> 06:29.920
In the past 15 years,

06:31.240 --> 06:33.400
I've run through countless possibilities.

06:34.200 --> 06:36.560
Your order has reached
the forces outside the city.

06:37.320 --> 06:39.000
My message has been sent as well.

06:39.840 --> 06:42.000
The regional commanders
are waiting for the result.

06:42.960 --> 06:45.560
Those old, calculating fence-sitters

06:49.800 --> 06:51.600
will not act

06:52.640 --> 06:54.360
until they see your head

06:55.840 --> 06:57.800
or my corpse.

07:00.720 --> 07:02.920
Impressive, White Hair.

07:03.680 --> 07:05.400
You have long surpassed

07:06.280 --> 07:07.720
your father.

07:09.600 --> 07:10.680
Indeed.

07:13.440 --> 07:15.000
The night my family was slaughtered,

07:17.080 --> 07:19.640
I learned never to show mercy to an enemy.

07:21.200 --> 07:23.200
The night before you killed him,

07:25.280 --> 07:27.280
he intended to strike first.

07:29.160 --> 07:30.640
He kept

07:32.560 --> 07:34.360
repeating your name at home.

07:36.160 --> 07:37.840
Yes, you rose in power,

07:39.000 --> 07:40.840
but you were his first disciple.

07:42.720 --> 07:44.640
He still believed

07:46.640 --> 07:48.200
his own disciple

07:49.960 --> 07:52.240
would not be so ruthless

07:54.080 --> 07:56.480
as to deal him such a cruel blow.

08:00.520 --> 08:02.360
After tonight,

08:03.560 --> 08:05.560
there will be no more Yan Fengshan.

08:07.960 --> 08:09.520
When tomorrow comes,

08:10.920 --> 08:13.680
what will you live for?

08:16.560 --> 08:18.400
What will I live for?

08:22.880 --> 08:24.760
When I escaped back then,

08:25.640 --> 08:27.520
I hid in the city for a long time.

08:28.400 --> 08:31.520
Every day, I watched people
walking through the streets,

08:32.200 --> 08:33.919
busy, rushing.

08:34.640 --> 08:36.840
And I wondered:

08:37.919 --> 08:40.400
"Why do they hurry?"

08:43.360 --> 08:46.240
"How is it they all
have homes to return to?"

08:48.360 --> 08:50.320
That was when I understood

08:51.840 --> 08:53.400
there would be nothing left

08:55.760 --> 08:58.000
for me to hope for.

08:58.880 --> 09:00.240
Then tomorrow,

09:01.120 --> 09:03.800
walk around Chang'an.

09:04.680 --> 09:06.320
Sometimes,

09:07.280 --> 09:10.840
the city has beautiful sights.

09:10.920 --> 09:11.880
All right.

09:15.320 --> 09:17.880
Finish it, White Hair.

09:29.760 --> 09:30.600
No.

09:32.000 --> 09:33.840
You must die slowly.

09:35.360 --> 09:36.720
That hurts more.

10:45.160 --> 10:46.160
Farewell,

10:47.200 --> 10:48.560
General Fengshan.

11:40.160 --> 11:41.240
General Fengshan ordered

11:41.320 --> 11:42.840
that we slaughter Xiao Wuyang's army.

11:42.920 --> 11:44.080
Good.

11:44.160 --> 11:46.560
After surrounding them for so long,
we can finally finish them off.

11:48.840 --> 11:49.880
I received word.

11:50.400 --> 11:53.720
A young man named Xie Huai'an
says he is one step away

11:53.800 --> 11:55.560
from killing Yan Fengshan.

11:55.640 --> 11:57.560
He wants us to wait two more hours.

12:00.320 --> 12:02.840
What we are doing
will either crown a new emperor

12:02.920 --> 12:04.600
or mark ourselves as traitors.

12:04.680 --> 12:06.040
Two hours

12:07.240 --> 12:08.280
is worth waiting.

12:35.080 --> 12:35.960
Gentlemen,

12:37.280 --> 12:38.680
time to decide.

12:40.240 --> 12:43.600
Without Yan Fengshan,
you lack the strength

12:44.240 --> 12:46.360
to seize Chang'an on your own.

12:48.440 --> 12:50.360
His Majesty is still alive,
and so is Gu Yu.

12:51.240 --> 12:54.680
Think carefully before choosing your side.

12:55.960 --> 12:58.080
You all earned great merit
under the founding emperor.

12:58.600 --> 13:00.920
Why not leave a good name
for your descendants?

13:01.560 --> 13:03.840
His Majesty has granted me full authority.

13:05.240 --> 13:07.080
I can promise you this:

13:08.640 --> 13:10.640
if the four of you lay down your weapons,

13:11.160 --> 13:14.040
the siege will be wiped clean,

13:14.560 --> 13:17.880
and the matter of military command
can be renegotiated.

14:04.920 --> 14:06.440
Yan Fengshan is dead.

14:06.520 --> 14:07.640
Huben shadow guards,

14:07.720 --> 14:09.560
whether fleeing or hiding,

14:09.640 --> 14:10.880
surrender, and live!

14:11.520 --> 14:12.960
Yan Fengshan is dead.

14:13.040 --> 14:13.880
Huben shadow guards,

14:13.960 --> 14:15.800
whether fleeing or hiding,

14:15.880 --> 14:17.720
surrender, and live!

14:20.080 --> 14:21.640
Yan Fengshan is dead.

14:21.720 --> 14:22.560
Huben shadow guards,

14:22.640 --> 14:24.520
whether fleeing or hiding,

14:24.600 --> 14:25.520
surrender, and live!

14:26.480 --> 14:27.920
Yan Fengshan is dead.

14:28.000 --> 14:28.880
Huben shadow guards,

14:28.960 --> 14:30.960
whether fleeing or hiding,

14:31.040 --> 14:32.560
surrender, and live!

14:32.640 --> 14:34.000
Yan Fengshan is dead.

14:34.080 --> 14:34.920
Huben shadow guards,

14:35.000 --> 14:36.880
whether fleeing or hiding,

14:36.960 --> 14:38.200
surrender, and live!

14:38.720 --> 14:40.160
Yan Fengshan is dead.

14:40.240 --> 14:41.120
Huben shadow guards,

14:41.200 --> 14:43.120
whether fleeing or hiding,

14:43.200 --> 14:44.600
surrender, and live!

15:17.160 --> 15:23.440
IMPERIAL PHYSICIAN'S HALL

15:26.040 --> 15:27.320
Stop worrying so much.

15:27.840 --> 15:29.880
What if your senior brother guessed wrong?

15:30.960 --> 15:31.800
Besides,

15:31.880 --> 15:34.600
if that boy meant you harm,
he'd have poisoned the snow-pear tonic.

15:35.200 --> 15:36.240
You finished it, and nothing…

15:51.440 --> 15:53.320
Mr. Xie Huai'an sent us to inform you

15:53.400 --> 15:54.760
that Yan Fengshan is dead.

16:00.280 --> 16:01.160
He's dead?

16:01.240 --> 16:02.600
Are you sure?

16:03.120 --> 16:04.640
Are you sure the body wasn't switched?

16:08.480 --> 16:09.320
What about

16:10.320 --> 16:11.360
Xie Huai'an?

16:11.440 --> 16:12.920
Where is he?

16:13.000 --> 16:14.280
Did he personally confirm the body?

16:14.880 --> 16:16.200
Just a while ago,

16:16.280 --> 16:19.520
Mr. Xie took Yan Fengshan's head
out of the city to end the battle.

16:24.720 --> 16:26.000
Didn't you hear that?

16:26.080 --> 16:27.600
Yan Fengshan is dead!

16:32.840 --> 16:34.160
I want to walk alone for a while.

17:01.280 --> 17:03.680
Mr. Xie also instructed us
to inform you of another matter.

17:04.200 --> 17:05.400
It concerns Ye Zheng.

17:38.600 --> 17:39.560
Greetings, Mr. Xie.

17:43.680 --> 17:46.120
The armies of the four regional commanders
have begun to withdraw.

17:46.200 --> 17:47.240
Inside the city,

17:48.160 --> 17:50.720
Gu Yu placed a 100-man Baiwenhu unit
at my disposal.

17:51.840 --> 17:54.800
I've sent people into the palace
to clear out the Huben forces.

17:55.520 --> 17:57.000
His Majesty is safe.

17:57.520 --> 17:58.560
There is no need for worry.

17:59.240 --> 18:00.800
Where is His Majesty now?

18:04.560 --> 18:07.680
Please wait a few more days.

18:08.280 --> 18:09.120
His Majesty

18:09.960 --> 18:11.320
will return.

19:24.640 --> 19:25.600
Your Majesty,

19:30.480 --> 19:32.160
are these candles for him?

19:34.280 --> 19:37.200
Many have already lit candles
for General Fengshan.

19:37.800 --> 19:39.120
I lit these for myself.

19:39.960 --> 19:42.760
It is said that after death,

19:42.840 --> 19:44.400
these lights help guide the soul

19:45.400 --> 19:46.520
so it does not lose its way.

19:52.960 --> 19:55.760
I was taken out of the mountains
by Huben members

19:55.840 --> 19:56.880
and raised by them.

19:57.800 --> 20:00.000
I always knew they weren't my real family.

20:00.640 --> 20:02.320
But without them,

20:02.880 --> 20:06.640
I would've been eaten by beasts
in the mountains long ago.

20:07.360 --> 20:10.440
No one in this world cares about me.

20:11.240 --> 20:12.480
After I die,

20:13.160 --> 20:15.240
no one will light a candle for me.

20:19.560 --> 20:20.520
I am ready.

20:54.520 --> 20:55.920
I know everything

20:57.880 --> 20:59.160
you just said.

21:02.280 --> 21:05.200
I also know you were involved
in my sister's death.

21:06.320 --> 21:07.880
The Huben Army saved you,

21:08.960 --> 21:11.360
but they also used you as a pawn.

21:12.680 --> 21:14.080
They dragged you into their game

21:15.400 --> 21:16.520
in that murder plot.

21:17.320 --> 21:18.400
Then,

21:18.480 --> 21:20.880
they made you stand before the world

21:20.960 --> 21:22.600
as a fake emperor.

21:23.200 --> 21:24.600
If it were me,

21:26.800 --> 21:28.880
I would never let a child

21:30.040 --> 21:31.960
bear that kind of guilt.

21:32.840 --> 21:34.560
You have repaid

21:35.160 --> 21:36.880
the Huben Army's kindness.

21:38.160 --> 21:40.040
You don't need to die here.

21:50.160 --> 21:52.320
But before the true emperor returns,

21:53.360 --> 21:55.800
you must remain on the throne

21:57.320 --> 21:59.280
to keep the realm steady.

22:00.120 --> 22:01.640
When all of this is over,

22:02.720 --> 22:04.680
I will find you a way to live.

22:06.920 --> 22:07.880
Perhaps

22:09.000 --> 22:11.480
I will find you a place
where no one knows you

22:12.840 --> 22:14.360
so you can live out your days in peace.

22:18.560 --> 22:21.120
I, Xie Huai'an,

22:21.720 --> 22:23.200
offer my respects to Your Majesty.

22:38.480 --> 22:40.240
I am sorry.

22:41.440 --> 22:42.360
I was wrong.

22:44.120 --> 22:45.760
I am sorry.

22:47.080 --> 22:48.400
I was wrong.

22:49.640 --> 22:51.400
I am sorry.

22:52.640 --> 22:54.160
I was wrong.

22:55.160 --> 22:57.080
I am sorry.

22:59.320 --> 23:00.880
I was wrong.

23:06.720 --> 23:10.000
TAIQING PALACE

24:26.600 --> 24:28.880
HOLD THE UNCARVED, KEEP THE TRUE

25:10.440 --> 25:11.880
This painting of you

25:12.680 --> 25:13.840
represents my wish for you.

25:15.160 --> 25:16.640
I hope you can tend flowers,

25:17.160 --> 25:18.000
keep a cat,

25:19.000 --> 25:20.120
nap on the porch,

25:21.400 --> 25:22.920
and live a peaceful life.

25:25.960 --> 25:27.080
Keep it with you,

25:28.040 --> 25:29.520
as if your family is still by your side.

25:41.000 --> 25:43.840
You must keep living.

26:14.280 --> 26:16.600
Your Majesty, all has been done
according to your instructions.

26:55.560 --> 26:57.040
Yan Fengshan is dead.

26:57.840 --> 26:59.280
The Huben Army has scattered.

26:59.800 --> 27:03.120
I knew we would soon see Your Majesty.

27:03.200 --> 27:05.800
You were playing
"Saying Goodbye," weren't you?

27:06.360 --> 27:09.520
It is somewhat fitting for tonight.

27:10.120 --> 27:13.840
That tune is nothing more
than feigned sorrow.

27:14.720 --> 27:17.520
The people here live in comfort.

27:18.200 --> 27:22.400
They have never tasted true hardship.

27:23.920 --> 27:26.000
Then play the "White Bone Ballad" instead.

27:26.720 --> 27:30.520
Let Chang'an be filled
with the sorrow of us Tiemo people.

27:30.600 --> 27:31.480
Yes, Your Majesty.

27:33.520 --> 27:37.320
KING OF TIEMO

28:13.120 --> 28:15.280
I have been looking for you.

28:34.440 --> 28:36.520
Had I known you were of Tiemo,

28:38.160 --> 28:39.960
I would've given you some Bitter-After

28:43.400 --> 28:45.160
when I bought it.

28:46.280 --> 28:49.080
Chewing Bitter-After would draw suspicion.

28:50.800 --> 28:52.800
I was trained as a shadow guard too.

28:53.680 --> 28:57.760
Not a single Tiemo habit
could remain with me.

29:03.880 --> 29:05.920
The King wants to see you.

29:06.000 --> 29:07.200
White Hair,

29:08.480 --> 29:09.480
come with me.

29:31.200 --> 29:32.520
Were you involved

29:33.600 --> 29:35.240
in my father's death?

29:35.880 --> 29:37.920
Your father showed me kindness.

29:38.760 --> 29:40.680
I was not in Chang'an then.

29:41.760 --> 29:43.400
But Tiemo was involved.

29:44.120 --> 29:46.440
To Tiemo, Liu Ziwen

29:46.520 --> 29:48.920
was someone who had to die.

29:49.520 --> 29:51.920
If you wish to know
how deeply we were involved,

29:52.000 --> 29:53.880
ask the King

29:54.400 --> 29:55.720
when you meet him.

29:57.120 --> 29:59.040
The Tiemo people killed my father,

30:00.080 --> 30:01.880
let Yan Fengshan rise,

30:03.240 --> 30:06.120
and waited for him and Xiao Wuyang
to tear each other apart.

30:06.200 --> 30:10.240
You cleared the Huben guards
outside Yan Fengshan's residence for me.

30:11.400 --> 30:14.440
And you sent me a puppet
that looked just like Wang Pu.

30:15.480 --> 30:17.200
Now that Yan Fengshan is dead

30:18.040 --> 30:20.200
and the regional commanders
have withdrawn,

30:20.880 --> 30:22.720
Chang'an

30:23.600 --> 30:25.680
is at its weakest.

30:26.280 --> 30:28.440
A well-laid plan indeed.

30:28.960 --> 30:31.320
About 40 years ago,

30:32.480 --> 30:36.520
there was a battle north of Chen Valley.

30:37.240 --> 30:40.600
There was no righteous or evil side.

30:41.200 --> 30:43.280
We wanted that piece of land,

30:43.840 --> 30:46.240
so war broke out.

30:48.080 --> 30:49.840
Back then, I was just a commoner,

30:50.880 --> 30:52.120
and I was ordered to evacuate.

30:53.920 --> 30:55.560
I stood by the river

30:56.440 --> 30:58.560
and watched others wade across,

30:59.080 --> 31:01.120
unable to bring myself to leave.

31:02.000 --> 31:03.400
I was worried

31:04.400 --> 31:06.600
that my sheep might not survive,

31:06.680 --> 31:10.760
that the hawk I caught might fly away,

31:11.920 --> 31:16.000
and that my house
might be burned to the ground.

31:17.080 --> 31:19.600
Someone crossing the river asked me,

31:20.320 --> 31:23.000
"Why aren't you worried
about your family?"

31:23.520 --> 31:24.360
Yes.

31:25.600 --> 31:28.400
My family should have been
my greatest concern.

31:29.000 --> 31:29.920
But…

31:34.600 --> 31:36.080
they were already gone.

31:37.800 --> 31:41.480
And they did not die in war.

31:42.080 --> 31:44.400
Tiemo's winters are bitter cold.

31:45.280 --> 31:48.040
Children born in winter rarely live

31:48.560 --> 31:51.360
to see the snow melt.

31:52.560 --> 31:54.000
My children

31:56.120 --> 31:58.000
were born in winter.

32:02.920 --> 32:05.680
We want our children to grow up safely.

32:07.480 --> 32:11.280
We want the sick
to have herbs for treatment.

32:12.520 --> 32:15.920
We want our cattle and sheep
to have steady grazing grounds.

32:16.960 --> 32:21.680
We want people to stop killing each other
over a scrap of dry food.

32:21.760 --> 32:22.920
But

32:26.400 --> 32:29.040
Tiemo's land is far too barren.

32:30.240 --> 32:31.400
So

32:32.320 --> 32:34.720
we had to take your land,

32:35.240 --> 32:36.840
no matter the cost,

32:37.600 --> 32:39.840
even if it meant
lying in wait for 30 years

32:41.320 --> 32:43.640
for the faintest chance.

32:49.680 --> 32:52.440
Our land also has young children

32:54.240 --> 32:55.880
and sick people.

32:56.560 --> 32:58.600
If we give all our land to Tiemo,

32:59.280 --> 33:00.480
how are we supposed to live?

33:01.720 --> 33:03.040
How are we supposed to live?

33:03.720 --> 33:05.200
You are right.

33:07.120 --> 33:07.960
But

33:11.600 --> 33:13.440
what does that have to do with me?

33:27.520 --> 33:29.120
It has nothing to do with you.

33:29.720 --> 33:31.360
Now that Yan Fengshan is dead,

33:32.280 --> 33:34.400
I am no longer of use to you.

33:35.600 --> 33:36.560
Mr. Long,

33:37.160 --> 33:39.160
you have no reason to take me

33:40.040 --> 33:41.240
to your king.

33:46.200 --> 33:48.120
Xiao Wuyang is missing, isn't he?

33:50.200 --> 33:52.080
When I went to see him,

33:53.640 --> 33:54.960
he had already awakened,

33:56.320 --> 33:59.280
but he told me not to say anything.

34:00.400 --> 34:02.440
I did not understand then.

34:03.800 --> 34:06.880
Now I do.

34:08.159 --> 34:10.080
You were controlling
the pace of his recovery

34:10.600 --> 34:11.760
just to delay

34:12.760 --> 34:14.920
when he would wake.

34:15.000 --> 34:16.880
You are White Hair.

34:17.440 --> 34:19.120
I cannot hide anything from you.

34:20.400 --> 34:22.280
Your ambush failed

34:22.360 --> 34:25.080
because your target was Xiao Wuyang,
the King of Death.

34:26.480 --> 34:27.920
You never stood a chance.

34:28.600 --> 34:30.360
With you in our hands,

34:31.719 --> 34:33.199
he will show himself sooner or later.

35:42.280 --> 35:43.320
Let's search over there.

35:44.000 --> 35:44.840
Come on.

36:12.120 --> 36:14.920
Tiemo's winters are freezing cold.

36:16.080 --> 36:18.280
Wolves come to steal livestock,

36:18.360 --> 36:21.120
and herders must shoot them down.

36:22.160 --> 36:25.600
Forced to walk
into the boundless snowfields,

36:27.120 --> 36:30.560
some never make it back.

36:32.640 --> 36:33.960
The next year,

36:34.760 --> 36:37.440
when winter ends and the snow melts,

36:37.520 --> 36:40.640
a mother who has lost her child

36:41.200 --> 36:43.000
finds a pile of white bones on the ground.

36:43.080 --> 36:45.720
Those bones belong
to the wolves and her son.

36:47.680 --> 36:50.640
She makes a flute
out of the wolves' bones,

36:51.160 --> 36:52.400
and its mournful sound

36:53.320 --> 36:55.560
echoes across Tiemo's land.

36:55.640 --> 36:57.160
That is the "White Bone Ballad."

37:03.480 --> 37:04.760
General Gu,

37:05.680 --> 37:09.440
you may have heard the story,

37:10.040 --> 37:11.520
but what you don't know

37:12.560 --> 37:16.320
is that Tiemo shadow guards
entered Chang'an

37:17.240 --> 37:19.080
20 years ago.

37:20.080 --> 37:24.120
They've long blended into the city,

37:24.200 --> 37:26.920
living as ordinary people.

37:27.000 --> 37:29.360
They learned Chang'an's culture,

37:29.440 --> 37:31.240
weaving, and tailoring,

37:31.960 --> 37:34.360
their skill no worse than the locals'.

37:35.000 --> 37:38.120
Some even married people of Chang'an

37:38.200 --> 37:39.480
and had children,

37:39.560 --> 37:42.440
enjoying an ordinary, peaceful life.

37:42.960 --> 37:44.440
But we had an agreement:

37:44.520 --> 37:49.000
when the "White Bone Ballad"
echoes over Chang'an,

37:49.080 --> 37:51.600
that will be the moment
they return to their true nature.

38:17.360 --> 38:18.600
Young man,

38:21.760 --> 38:23.280
it really is you.

38:23.360 --> 38:26.560
Why are you out in such a panic
in the middle of the night?

38:26.640 --> 38:28.520
Did you provoke
someone you shouldn't have,

38:28.600 --> 38:29.560
and now they're after you?

38:29.640 --> 38:31.280
The city is in chaos.

38:31.360 --> 38:32.520
It's dangerous at night.

38:33.320 --> 38:35.320
Why don't you come inside
and sit for a bit?

38:40.280 --> 38:45.040
INCENSES AND CANDLES

38:58.320 --> 39:01.040
Young man, your hair…

39:03.840 --> 39:07.080
Both times we met,
you looked completely lost.

39:07.160 --> 39:08.280
What happened tonight?

39:10.000 --> 39:11.520
A thief broke into my home.

39:12.240 --> 39:13.520
I came out to report it.

39:14.960 --> 39:18.280
Chang'an grows more unsafe by the day.

39:18.880 --> 39:20.160
Ill fortune clings to you.

39:23.200 --> 39:25.240
Wash your face first. Here.

39:33.400 --> 39:35.880
-Go on. Here.
-Thank you.

39:35.960 --> 39:37.360
Think nothing of it.

39:37.880 --> 39:40.280
I feel for those who suffer.

39:41.080 --> 39:42.240
Everyone in this world suffers.

39:42.320 --> 39:44.440
Everyone suffers.

40:15.680 --> 40:18.000
General Gu, do you know?

40:19.560 --> 40:22.120
The wolves prey on our livestock,

40:22.200 --> 40:25.920
yet we Tiemo people
still take the wolf as our totem,

40:26.640 --> 40:29.080
because the wolves taught us
how to plunder.

40:29.760 --> 40:31.280
We Tiemo people

40:31.360 --> 40:35.280
don't deserve to live forever
on cold, barren land.

40:36.040 --> 40:38.520
So we must ride out and plunder.

40:38.600 --> 40:40.880
We must seize fertile ground.

40:42.400 --> 40:45.200
Not a patch of Chang'an's land

40:46.160 --> 40:47.720
will you ever take.

40:49.480 --> 40:52.200
Not a single resident of Chang'an

40:55.160 --> 40:57.000
will submit to you.

40:58.920 --> 41:01.520
Hasn't your army
already been cut down by mine?

41:02.240 --> 41:05.760
Aren't you already my spoils of war?

41:06.560 --> 41:08.440
Chang'an is about to fall.

41:10.160 --> 41:11.480
What else do you have to say?

41:12.160 --> 41:13.480
Rest assured.

41:14.800 --> 41:17.200
Chang'an will not fall.

41:18.560 --> 41:22.680
Right now, I pity only my warhorse.

41:23.800 --> 41:26.080
It carried me out of the city to fight

41:26.160 --> 41:28.800
and carried me back to die.

41:50.920 --> 41:53.240
You're bleeding out,

41:53.320 --> 41:55.440
yet you still had that move hidden?

42:01.800 --> 42:03.240
A pity

42:05.000 --> 42:07.520
I'm a cripple.

42:51.160 --> 42:52.520
You're from Tiemo.

42:53.640 --> 42:54.520
Tell me

42:55.840 --> 42:57.000
where your master is.

42:59.840 --> 43:02.600
Fortunately,
there are still those in Chang'an

43:04.040 --> 43:06.600
you cannot defeat.
